  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation of Priority Area 1 - MIP 2021-2027 Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of this assignment is to provide support to the European Union Delegation to Mongolia in identifying and formulating actions under Priority Area 1: Green Sustainable Development as outlined in the EU MIP for Mongolia (2021-2027), and in formulating the Roadmap for the Forest Partnership, in consultation with the Government and relevant stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
